# Domains - obsidian (actions/obsidian/obsidian_domains.kbd)
**spc + b** -- Bookmarks
**spc + c** -- Calendar
**spc + e** -- Explorer
**spc + h** -- Hyperlinks
**spc + p** -- Properties
**spc + s** -- Symbols
**spc + u** -- UI
**spc + ;** -- Commands
**spc + ,** -- Settings
**spc + [** -- Backlinks
**spc + ]** -- Outlinks
